@@ -1,339 +0,0 @@
-/****************************************************************************
- *
- * gxvfeat.c
- *
- *   TrueTypeGX/AAT feat table validation (body).
- *
- * Copyright (C) 2004-2023 by
- * suzuki toshiya, Masatake YAMATO, Red Hat K.K.,
