@@ -1,188 +0,0 @@
-/****************************************************************************
- *
- * pfrcmap.c
- *
- *   FreeType PFR cmap handling (body).
- *
- * Copyright (C) 2002-2023 by
- * David Turner, Robert Wilhelm, and Werner Lemberg.
