-
-  /**************************************************************************
-   *
-   * @Function:
-   *   Project_x
-   *
-   * @Description:
-   *   Computes the projection of the vector given by (v2-v1) along the
-   *   horizontal axis.
-   *
-   * @Input:
-   *   v1 ::
-   *     First input vector.
-   *   v2 ::
-   *     Second input vector.
