-
-  /**************************************************************************
-   *
-   * DUP[]:        DUPlicate the stack's top element
-   * Opcode range: 0x20
-   * Stack:        StkElt --> StkElt StkElt
-   */
-  static void
-  Ins_DUP( FT_Long*  args )
